  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s been quite a stir in the Pumpkaboo fan\ncommunity over the recent discovery...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“Recent discovery”?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C0052006500630065006E007400200064006900730063006F0076006500720079201D003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What kind of stir?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006100740020006B0069006E00640020006F006600200073007400690072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pumpkaboo used to be sorted based on their size:\nSmall Size, Average Size, Large Size, or Super Size.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "However!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F00770065007600650072002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s come to light that the differences between\nthem go beyond just size!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So now they are called Small Variety, Medium\nVariety, Large Variety, and Jumbo Variety.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t you think the new names sound more like\ndifferent breeds than anything else? I do!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want to see if they really are that different, so\nI’ve been collecting Pumpkaboo varieties.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I haven’t had any luck finding the largest, the\nJumbo Variety.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020004900200068006100760065006E20190074002000680061006400200061006E00790020006C00750063006B002000660069006E00640069006E006700200074006800650020006C006100720067006500730074002C0020007400680065000A004A0075006D0062006F00200056006100720069006500740079002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re said to appear at night in Wild Zone 15.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500792019007200650020007300610069006400200074006F00200061007000700065006100720020006100740020006E006900670068007400200069006E002000570069006C00640020005A006F006E0065002000310035002E00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, I need you to catch a Jumbo Variety\nPumpkaboo for me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002C002000490020006E00650065006400200079006F007500200074006F002000630061007400630068002000610020004A0075006D0062006F00200056006100720069006500740079000A00500075006D0070006B00610062006F006F00200066006F00720020006D0065002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’ll be EVEN bigger than the Pumpkaboo I have\nhere, if you can believe that!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, there’s one more thing! Please don’t bring me\nan alpha Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s hard to determine what variety it is when it’s\nalpha-sized.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you bring me a Jumbo Variety Pumpkaboo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006400200079006F00750020006200720069006E00670020006D0065002000610020004A0075006D0062006F00200056006100720069006500740079002000500075006D0070006B00610062006F006F003F00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You bet!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000620065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200079006500740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not even a Jumbo Variety could contain all my\nexcitement! Please, let me have it at once!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please help me in my search for a Pumpkaboo of\nthe Jumbo Variety.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThey’re said to appear at night in Wild Zone 15.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Jumbo Variety alpha!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo thanks! I mean, it’s lovely, but there’s no\ntelling how many spirits a Pumpkaboo of this size<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwill end up carrying off to the afterlife.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 173
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not even a Jumbo Variety could contain all my\ndisappointment! No more alpha Pokémon, please.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Jumbo Variety Pumpkaboo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020004A0075006D0062006F00200056006100720069006500740079002000500075006D0070006B00610062006F006F002100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So this variety carries jumbo-sized spirits to the\nafterlife in its huge body? How mysterious!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Even if they look similar, I can see how these\ndifferent varieties are indeed different forms!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...Forgive me.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTo be honest, I don’t really get it, but how could I\nNOT be convinced by the size of that Pokémon?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "From now on, I’ll nurture my own spirit so it’s big\nenough to require a Jumbo Variety someday!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "From the bottom of my heart, thank you for\nbringing me a Jumbo Variety Pumpkaboo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now that I have all four varieties of Pumpkaboo,\nspirits of any size can be carried to the afterlife.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIf you ever need them, please let me know!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    }
